{"author":"Unknown","author_email":"","data":{"content_hash":"d805c270fc94a50bd8ea1bc3415330814bc24b69ee09daf9b89e54de30474183","digest":{"component_or_area":"Gerrit CI/CD verification workflow","key_entities":[".github/workflows/_optionality.yml",".github/workflows/optionality.yml",".github/workflows/gerrit-verify.yaml",".github/actions/smart-checkout","checkout-gerrit-change-action","vote job needs","GERRIT_SSH_PRIVKEY","actionlint"],"problem_keywords":["optionality checks","gerrit verified vote","clean wheel packaging","runtime regression","reusable workflow","pre-merge validation"],"propositions":["The optionality workflow (clean-wheel, per-extra, union checks) does not cast a Gerrit Verified vote, allowing module-scope heavy-import regressions to reach main uncaught.","Runtime and packaging validation jobs must run in the Gerrit Verified lane before the vote is cast to prevent clean-wheel/packaging failures from bypassing pre-merge checks.","Optionality's jobs must be extracted into a reusable workflow_call and invoked from both the push/PR lane and gerrit-verify.yaml, with the optionality job added to vote's needs dependency.","The gerrit lane must check out the exact patchset via checkout-gerrit-change-action, never plain actions/checkout, to prevent false passes from resolving to main.","The reusable workflow must not use secrets: inherit; Gerrit values must be passed as plain inputs only to prevent fork-PR exposure of GERRIT_SSH_PRIVKEY."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b2b5c498-2f67-4ae3-bafc-eca40294bec2","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1785818156756631596,"uuid":"d3cee6fe-31e4-440e-bbd9-98557581581d"}